;    1: TDecorate(count=34, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=34, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=しんぴょうせい, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=605, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=530, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\SE\caterpillar.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\伐採.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE>, are you really sure about this?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One of the residents said it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before our eyes stood a crowd of outsiders.<PG>
They had come to dig up the cherry trees of this land.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Less than 10 days after <STYLE ID="2">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> came, the workers and machines to dig up the cherry trees had arrived.<PG>
An invasion of outsiders, and the loss of the cherry trees from which Droga is made.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The residents must have been unbearably anxious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But this is as it should be.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everything has its cause and effect.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A dreamlike drug such as Droga cannot possibly be of use to people without some price.<PG>
In place of Droga, <STYLE ID="2">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> had provided us with several firearms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With these, hunting would be easier even without Droga.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
That day when <STYLE ID="2">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> first came―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\和ぴあの２.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\篠崎ハジメバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\エデン\ドローガ瓶.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So these are the crystals of the drug..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Please burn them and use the smoke. This sets down how they are made."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I gave Shinozaki-san the Droga crystals and the method of making it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, Droga's effects would gain <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="しんぴょうせい">credibility</STYLE>, and matters would move along quickly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\線路.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And just as <STYLE ID="2">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> had said, a railway really was built.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Its purpose, of course, was to transport the many cherry trees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With funds on such a scale, had <STYLE ID="2">Shinozaki-san</STYLE> truly been from the government after all?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―In about half a year, every cherry tree but the one at the Niimura main house had been dug up and carried away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In any case, the unraveling of Droga would now move forward.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------